      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could have that issue in the current code, right?\nCurrent code send the broadcast before acquiring the lock.\n```\npublic void setAndReportNetworkActive(boolean active, int transportType, long tsNanos) {\n  sendDataActivityBroadcast(transportTypeToLegacyType(transportType), active, tsNanos);\n    synchronized (mActiveIdleTimers) {\n       mNetworkActive \u003d active;\n```\n\nBut that could be a issue, thanks for pointing this out.",
